REQ-ARC-FCP-5699-14 through -20 characterized (tier 1's search-mechanics
wall): not a search-budget problem, not a gradient problem, but an
upstream code-synthesis correctness problem -- the LLM isn't producing
dynamics code that predicts these games' mechanics at all, on first
contact. Scope limit: characterizes failure MAGNITUDE from recorded
metrics, not yet WHY (the actual prompt/generated code was not inspected).

